  expr_varargs_err_count_call.pcpp - break step of expr_varargs.pcpp:
  varargs.count called (SM0424)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\expr_varargs_err_count_call.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\expr_varargs_err_count_call.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
